# Design evidence activity view. No reader format/accounting choice or native verdict.
direction: down
classes: {
  start: {style: {fill: "#25364B"; font-color: "#FFFFFF"; bold: true; stroke-width: 3}}
}
Start: "Start here · Freeze the finite subject\nFixed indexed predicate; declared host roots" {class: start}
Classify: "Classify every query path\nChecked app directories; other paths retained separately"
Baseline: "Complete bounded host directory census\nRequired launchers, system apps and observed helpers"
Inventory: "Independent inventories\nEvery direct locale + fixed information/name families\nLoctable keys differ from lproj directories"
Fixtures: "Disk-only controlled subject\n1,010 useful apps · 256 helpers · 128 aliases\nSeven exact long roots + two same-ID short copies"
Freeze: "Compare before and after\nFile identities, bytes, hashes and complete inventories\nInstrument and design-input digests"
Worksheet: "Evidence worksheet\nRepeated reads charge again\nAll-locale census is not a production read plan"
Choice: "Next · Antony's coupled selection\nLoctable-capable plan; sound gross budget first\nNo new format, gate or refund adopted here"
Design: "Then · Complete k215 reader design\nReconcile whole family; mandatory review before k7\nConsumption hold remains until coherent design"
Native: "Separate pending native qualification\nSupported VM baseline, signed useful fixtures\nActual batches/type/tuples/registration and G/N/V"
Start -> Classify: "1 · actual fixed query"
Classify -> Baseline: "2 · bounded contents scope only"
Baseline -> Inventory: "3 · no locale or helper subset"
Fixtures -> Freeze: "4 · actual constructed metadata bytes"
Inventory -> Freeze: "4 · actual measured baseline bytes"
Freeze -> Worksheet: "5 · unchanged per-item records"
Worksheet -> Choice: "6 · concrete measured alternatives"
Choice -> Design: "7 · human selection before adoption"
Design -> Native: "8 · design checks supply no native pass"
